    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "What a splendid blizzard eve! Ladies and gentlemen, welcome, welcome, please come in. Allow the servants to brush the snow off your tops, and thaw yourselves by the brazier."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Finely-Dressed Merchant",
        "text": "A good evening to you, Count. Truly a magnificent soir\u00e9e, this is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "Welcome, welcome, Lady Diana. To meet you on the eve of the New Year is my honor entirely."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Finely-Dressed Merchant",
        "text": "Nonsense. Now take a look, Count. I've a present for you, all the way from Kazimierz."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "What a beautiful pendant! My greatest thanks, Lady Diana, and send my well-wishes to your husband. Now, hurry along inside, we can't have the snow burying your gorgeous looks."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Finely-Dressed Merchant",
        "text": "Hah! You speak as fine a line as ever."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "Oh-ho, look who's here! If it isn't our 'Baron of Rye!'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Courteous Nobleman",
        "text": "I could never shoulder a title as hefty as Baron, but here I am anyway, the pure nerve!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "See what you're saying! We all respect you from the bottom of our hearts. Who spurns the man who feeds his people well, now? Ha ha ha!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Courteous Nobleman",
        "text": "Ah, you're quite right. Once harvest comes next year, I'd be honored if you visit my humble home. The tallest windmills in Toron, the scent of flour everywhere. A stay sure to enchant you, if I do say so myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "Quite good! This blizzard shall pass, and next year will come trotting in right behind it with fine, fine harvests."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Courteous Nobleman",
        "text": "My gratitude for your kind words."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "Head in and warm yourself up, now. We're serving the spiced bread you so love tonight\u2014of course, baked with most exquisite, fragrant flour, all sourced from your farms."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Courteous Nobleman",
        "text": "How about you? Won't you come in? It's almost time... Let your good servants welcome the remaining guests."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "Perhaps you speak sense, but no matter. I like to greet my invitees personally. They're all the most adorable people, whether noble or merchant, cleric or soldier."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "Toron is a fine, fine place, isn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Courteous Nobleman",
        "text": "Why, you character, you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_170_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Count Vincent",
        "text": "Now, let me see, we still have the Mister and Misses Arizona, that admirable lighthouse operator, and... hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
